=====================================================================
Project annotations
=====================================================================

This project created these annotations:

- difficulty.mohs, a calibration onto a 1 to 10 scale, not a measurement
  supplied by the source datasets
- the category label assigned by this project
- data/index.json

That material is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International License (CC BY 4.0). Using it does not license the problem it
is attached to.

License text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

=====================================================================
Problem text, solutions, answers, and diagrams
=====================================================================

The contents of problems/ and images/ (statements, solutions, answers,
choices, and diagrams) are normalized copies of third-party collections.
This repository does not hold those copyrights and does not relicense them.

An earlier version of this file placed problems/, images/, and data/ under
CC BY 4.0. That sentence was this project's claim. It was not a grant from
the contest organizers or the dataset authors, and it does not apply to the
problem text, solutions, answers, choices, or diagrams. The terms that do
apply are recorded in docs/datasets.md. Several of them are narrower than
CC BY 4.0. CEMC material is CC BY-NC 4.0.

